  "operative_text": "Section 1 (R.C. 2923.126(B)(7)(b)): Division (B)(7)(a) of this section does not prohibit a licensee who is an elected officeholder of this state or a political subdivision of this state from carrying a concealed handgun in a government facility of this state or a political subdivision of this state."
